# Local scan state. These patterns are deliberately unanchored (**/) so a Trinker project
# nested anywhere in the tree — an example, a fixture, a vendored target — is covered too.
# `.trinker/plan.json` is intentionally NOT ignored: the plan is a reviewable security artifact
# and is meant to be committed and diffed.
**/.trinker/runtime.json
**/.trinker/latest-report.json
**/.trinker/proposal.json
**/.trinker/reports/
**/.trinker/events/
**/.trinker/cache/
